# Browser-visible configuration must use an explicit PUBLIC_ prefix.
# Runner OS has no client-side environment variables.

# Server-only secrets are configured with Cloudflare Pages secrets.
# Authentication uses random per-user salts and PBKDF2 hashes stored in D1;
# no shared auth secret is required.
# Never place production values in this file.
# Optional Phase 4 server-only bindings (configure as Cloudflare Pages secrets):
# GROK_API_KEY=
# GROK_MODEL=grok-3-mini
# STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=
# STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Strava remains unavailable until OAuth state/token storage is implemented safely.
